<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('../partials/nav') %>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap-sm">
      <div style="margin-bottom:32px;">
        <div class="eyebrow">Tanpa Login</div>
        <h1>Pesanan Saya</h1>
        <p style="color:var(--text-dim); margin-top:8px; font-size:14px; max-width:520px;">
          Setiap kali checkout, kode invoice tersimpan otomatis di perangkat ini — jadi kamu nggak perlu bikin akun atau catat kode manual.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="notice notice-gem" style="margin-bottom:24px;">
        <b>💡 Info:</b> Data ini tersimpan di browser/perangkat ini saja. Kalau ganti HP atau hapus data browser, riwayat hilang — tapi kode invoice di WA/email konfirmasi tetap jadi bukti utama.
      </div>

      <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:16px;">
        <h2 style="font-size:15px; font-weight:600;">Riwayat di Perangkat Ini</h2>
        <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;">
          <span id="countLabel" style="font-size:12.5px; color:var(--text-dim);">0 pesanan</span>
          <button id="clearAll" class="btn btn-sm" style="background:none; border:1px solid var(--border); color:var(--text-dim); font-size:12px;">
            🗑 Hapus Semua
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="orderList"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
  <script src="/js/pesanan-saya.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
